From: Andreas Baierl <ichgeh@imkreisrum.de>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 13:10:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 40/59] Add audio and subtitle track selection

Implement the component API of OIPF DAE 7.16.5 (getComponents,
selectComponent, ...) for the A/V object and video/broadcast, and
audioTracks for HTML5 video. The tracks come from the transcoder or,
for live TV, from the channel data of VDR.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
